# MediAccess AI — AI-Powered Voice-First Accessible Telemedicine App

## 1. Project Overview

Build a production-ready Flutter mobile application called **MediAccess AI**.

MediAccess AI is an AI-powered, voice-first accessible telemedicine platform designed to remove communication barriers between doctors and patients with different abilities.

The application must support:

- Normal users
- Blind/visually impaired users
- Deaf/hearing-impaired users
- Speech-impaired users
- Deaf + speech-impaired users

The most important requirement is:

**Almost every major feature of the application must be accessible through natural voice commands.**

The app should not behave like a normal app with a microphone button added as an extra feature. It should be designed as a voice-first healthcare application.

**Important additional requirement:** The very first screen must be a professional Login / Role Selection screen where users choose whether to continue as a Patient or a Doctor. Patients must be able to select their accessibility profile during registration or first-time onboarding. Doctors must have a separate login, registration, and dashboard.

Do not remove or simplify any of the existing requirements to accommodate this login screen.

