## 32. Final Product Goal

The final app should communicate the following core idea:

**MediAccess AI is a voice-first, AI-powered accessible telemedicine platform that allows people with different abilities to independently search for doctors, book and manage appointments, communicate during consultations, access prescriptions, and navigate healthcare services using voice, text, and sign language.**

The application must begin with a secure, accessible Patient/Doctor role selection and authentication experience, followed by the appropriate dashboard and patient accessibility configuration.

Do not add unnecessary features that are not related to this core objective.

Focus on making the voice-first healthcare experience, secure authentication, accessibility, AI intent understanding, appointment workflow, consultation, and sign-language communication functional and polished.